      "comment": "Invokes graphics interface virtual function with command and data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load graphics interface pointer from global g_pGfxInterface\n2. Retrieve graphics interface virtual method table pointer\n3. Call virtual function at offset 0xb4 (graphics command handler)\n4. Pass data parameter via stack and return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandle (uint): Graphics context or state identifier\n- byCommand (byte): Command code specifying operation type\n- dwData (uint): Command parameter or data payload\n\nReturns:\n- void (return value from virtual function discarded)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xb4 (180): Virtual method table offset for graphics command handler",
