      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Calls virtual function at offset 0xD0 of the graphics interface vtable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load graphics interface pointer from global g_pGfxInterface\n2. Load param2 into EDX register\n3. Load param1 into ECX register  \n4. Call virtual function at vtable offset 0xD0 (method index 52)\n5. Return with 8 bytes stack cleanup (stdcall)\n\nParameters:\n- nParam1 (int): First parameter passed in ECX to virtual method\n- nParam2 (int): Second parameter passed in EDX to virtual method\n\nReturns:\n- int: Return value from virtual function in EAX\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper\n- Wraps vtable call at offset 0xD0 on g_pGfxInterface\n- Vtable index = 0xD0/4 = 52\n\nRelated:\n- g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c): Graphics interface object pointer",
