      "comment": "Calls virtual function at offset 0xD4 of the graphics interface vtable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load graphics interface pointer from g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c)\n2. Indirect jump to virtual function at vtable offset 0xD4 (method index 53)\n3. Tail call - does not return here, returns directly to caller\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_pGfxInterface - Global graphics interface object pointer\n\nReturns:\n- Depends on underlying virtual method implementation\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper\n- Wraps vtable call at offset 0xD4 on g_pGfxInterface\n- Vtable method index = 0xD4/4 = 53\n- Uses tail call optimization (JMP instead of CALL)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GfxInterface_CallMethod0xD0 (0x6faa4390): Calls vtable offset 0xD0\n- g_pGfxInterface (0x6fabd21c): Graphics interface object pointer",
