      "signature": "long CxxFrameHandler(PEXCEPTION_RECORD pExcept, PVOID pFrame, DWORD dwEsp, PVOID pContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "long",
      "comment": "C++ exception handler dispatcher wrapper.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current EAX value to stack (exception context pointer)\n2. Prepare additional parameters (null pointers and zero)\n3. Call FUN_6faa74e9 (main exception handler implementation)\n4. Return exception disposition from handler\n\nParameters:\n- PEXCEPTION_RECORD param_1: Pointer to exception record structure\n- PVOID param_2: Frame pointer or context data\n- DWORD param_3: Stack pointer (ESP) at time of exception\n- undefined4 param_4: Additional context or handler parameter\n- IMPLICIT EAX: Contains saved exception context state\n\nReturns:\n- LONG: Exception disposition (typically 0 = continue search, 1 = handled, -1 = continue execution)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
