      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Raises an exception by forwarding to the exception handler.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extracts structure fields from context at offsets 0x8, 0xc, 0x10\n2. Calls exception handler with exception record and extracted parameters\n3. Returns void\n\nParameters:\n- pExcRecord (PEXCEPTION_RECORD): Exception record to raise\n- pContext (PVOID): Context structure containing handler parameters\n- dwFlags (DWORD): Flags for exception handling behavior\n\nReturns:\n- void (handler manages exception propagation)",
